From: Takashi Iwai <tiwai-l3A5Bk7waGM@public.gmane.org>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ALSA: usb-audio: Fix races at disconnection
Date: Fri, 12 Oct 2012 16:34:52 +0200
Message-ID: <s5h4nlzahdf.wl%tiwai@suse.de>
References: <s5h7gqvahf8.wl%tiwai@suse.de>
Mime-Version: 1.0 (generated by SEMI 1.14.6 - "Maruoka")
